1. Distribution structure

The official v1.0.2 release contains:

  * a finished JLPT MAX Deck APKG with vocabulary, audio, practice, and reference decks;
  * an optional local kanji builder;
  * SHA-256 checksums; and
  * a hash-bound public release manifest.

The JLPT MAX Deck APKG does not require a publisher PDF. The optional kanji deck is not
included in the JLPT MAX Deck APKG. It is built locally from the user's two supported
Gilbut PDFs.

